# A side-band role records a span, not a slot: only a pattern label
# fills it, never a `role:` item.
# error: schema_side_role_item.grammar:26:8:
# error: 'eq' is a side-band role of 't'; side-band roles are filled by pattern labels
@lexer
tokens
    ident
    integer
    plus
    colon
    comma
    eq
    eof
    err
'+'                                         → plus
':'                                         → colon
','                                         → comma
'='                                         → eq
[0-9]+                                      → integer
[a-z]+                                      → ident
.                                           → err

@parser
@schema
    t name:leaf | eq
top! = IDENT EQ                             → (t 1 eq:2)
